    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Narration again places hairy men as the variant men most skilled at refining Gu. According to those records, in the immemorial era they started to refine Gu and tied up Ren Zu’s first son Verdant Great Sun in an attempt to use him to refine eternal Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          486
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "repeated-legend-account",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
  "refinement": {
    "recipes": [],
    "used_in_recipes": [],
    "refinement_materials": [],
    "confirmed_evolutions": [],
    "related_variants": [],
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "They call human the spirit of all living beings and Ren Zu the spirit ancestor, and they treat Verdant Great Sun, born from Ren Zu’s left eye, as having ample spiritual energy for the work. One speaker says that throwing him into the cauldron will let them obtain eternal Gu and live for eternity. A voice in Verdant Great Sun’s mind names those captors as hairy men, loved by the world, with innate talent in refining Gu worms.",
        "chapters": [
          357
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "refinement-attempt",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_ren_zu",
          "race_hairy_men",
          "sys_gu_worms"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Hairy men keep adding materials and Gu worms, including Vanity Gu. After vanity Gu bursts into a formless poisonous wind, Verdant Great Sun goads the hairy men into burning themselves and escapes the cauldron, so the attempt does not finish in the telling.",
        "chapters": [
          357
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "refinement-attempt",
